<title>UK: OKB sets 150 mln stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>OKB sets 150 mln stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KONTROLLBANK AG</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    25.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  L 22.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> TAX PROVS  STANDARD  MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   0.875</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF A EURO-SHELF PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
